      "writtenOn": "2023-12-26T04:17:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s good for differnet project to configure their own parameters, but it\u0027s better to use config file instead of sysproperty.",
      "revId": "3fd0da30ccd386b4428c3e4c74196bf6d8b320d7",
